name=AKA - I Know What I Did
id=AkaIKnowWhatIDid
description=A diary that remembers only what YOU actually earned.
description=
description=Everything your character learned by playing is written down - the levels
description=your traits and occupation handed you at birth are not. Die, come back, read
description=your own handwriting, and get a configurable slice of that XP back.
description=
description=- Craft only, never loot: 1 Diary + 3 Phonebooks + 2 units of Adhesive Tape.
description=- Fill in and sign the new diary: character name and the nickname you choose.
description=- "Start recording skills" writes today's progress. "Remember my past" reads it back.
description=- Admin sets the restore percent (and every other rule) in Sandbox Options.
description=- The diary never forgets: writing again keeps whichever value is larger,
description=  so a short new life can never erase a long old one.
description=- Admin tools: right click the ground to inspect, repair, grant or erase any player's record.
description=- Multiplayer ready: the server owns the answer to who may read what.
